## Pre-Code Checklist

Before writing any code, confirm:

- [ ] Understand existing patterns in the codebase?
- [ ] Is this the simplest solution that works?
- [ ] Does each function do exactly ONE thing?
- [ ] Are names self-documenting (no abbreviations)?
- [ ] Input validated at entry point?
- [ ] Errors handled explicitly, not swallowed?
- [ ] No duplicated logic?
- [ ] No hidden side effects?
- [ ] Comments in English, explaining WHY?
- [ ] Frontend: types → api → hook → component structure?
- [ ] State/props: lowest scope, stable refs, no derivable duplicate state?
- [ ] Large data: chunked work, O(1) lookups, cleanup + memory bounded?
- [ ] Backend: controller thin, logic in service?
- [ ] File under 300 lines?
- [ ] Would a new dev understand this without asking questions?
- [ ] Component like button, card... uses Shacdn
- [ ] Follow correct color
